42035742035744}, {"text": "As you are listening to the recording, follow the questions. You may write notes if you wish", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.3776223776223776, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.39083139083139085}, {"text": "in the Candidate\u2019s Notes spaces provided on pages Anything you write in the Candidate\u2019s", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.3939393939393939, "x1": 0.8802197802197802, "y1": 0.40714840714840717}, {"text": "Notes spaces will NOT be marked. You may make notes or write your answers at any time as", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.411033411033411, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.42424242424242425}, {"text": "you are listening to the recording.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.42735042735042733, "x1": 0.3923076923076923, "y1": 0.4405594405594406}, {"text": "You will hear the recording and then the questions will be read aloud. You will hear the", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.46076146076146074, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.473970473970474}, {"text": "recording a SECOND time and then you will be given time to complete the answers.", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.47707847707847706, "x1": 0.8065934065934066, "y1": 0.4902874902874903}, {"text": "You now have two minutes to read the questions.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.5104895104895105, "x1": 0.5186813186813187, "y1": 0.5236985236985237}, {"text": "Note: A dune is a hill of sand found in the desert.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.5439005439005439, "x1": 0.5197802197802198, "y1": 0.554001554001554}, {"text": "\u2018Off Track\u2019 with Ann Jones: He's been through the desert ~ Podcast, 3 November 2018", "x0": 0.1978021978021978, "y0": 0.5617715617715617, "x1": 0.7087912087912088, "y1": 0.5835275835275835}, {"text": "Used with permission from the Australian Broadcasting Corporation Library Sales", "x0": 0.1956043956043956, "y0": 0.5796425796425796, "x1": 0.676923076923077, "y1": 0.5889665889665889}, {"text": "Question 1 (1 mark)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.6177156177156177, "x1": 0.2868131868131868, "y1": 0.6301476301476302}, {"text": "Why does Andrew Harper enjoy spending five months in the desert?", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.6511266511266511, "x1": 0.6758241758241759, "y1": 0.6643356643356644}, {"text": "NOTES: These notes will NOT be marked.", "x0": 0.26043956043956046, "y0": 0.822066822066822, "x1": 0.6043956043956044, "y1": 0.8321678321678322}], [{"text": "9287310054 |", "x0": 0.7769230769230769, "y0": 0.037296037296037296, "x1": 0.9307692307692308, "y1": 0.059052059052059055}, {"text": "Question 2 (2 marks)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.08158508158508158, "x1": 0.2945054945054945, "y1": 0.09401709401709402}, {"text": "According to Andrew Harper, what are the differences between desert walking and four-wheel", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.11499611499611499, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.1282051282051282}, {"text": "driving through the desert?", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.1320901320901321, "x1": 0.3373626373626374, "y1": 0.1452991452991453}, {"text": "Question 3 (2 marks)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.29603729603729606, "x1": 0.2945054945054945, "y1": 0.3084693084693085}, {"text": "In what ways is it a great shock for Andrew Harper to return to the city from the desert?", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.32944832944832947, "x1": 0.8351648351648352, "y1": 0.34265734265734266}, {"text": "Question 4 (3 marks)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.4933954933954934, "x1": 0.2945054945054945, "y1": 0.5058275058275058}, {"text": "How does the interviewer convey the unique nature of Andrew profession?", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.5268065268065268, "x1": 0.8043956043956044, "y1": 0.54001554001554}, {"text": "Please turn over", "x0": 0.42967032967032964, "y0": 0.7645687645687645, "x1": 0.5692307692307692, "y1": 0.7746697746697747}, {"text": "NOTES: These notes will NOT be marked.", "x0": 0.26043956043956046, "y0": 0.822066822066822, "x1": 0.6043956043956044, "y1": 0.8321678321678322}], [{"text": "Question 5 (3 marks)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.08158508158508158, "x1": 0.2945054945054945, "y1": 0.09401709401709402}, {"text": "Explain the significance of the metaphor \u2018cleansing freedom\u2019.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.11499611499611499, "x1": 0.6197802197802198, "y1": 0.1282051282051282}, {"text": "Question 6 (4 marks)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.33644133644133645, "x1": 0.2945054945054945, "y1": 0.34887334887334887}, {"text": "The stated aim of the podcast is \u2018to take you out of your car or your kitchen, wherever you're", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.36985236985236986, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.38306138306138304}, {"text": "listening, and put you out there in the outdoors\u2019.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.3861693861693862, "x1": 0.5098901098901099, "y1": 0.39937839937839936}, {"text": "How does the podcast achieve its purpose?", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.4195804195804196, "x1": 0.46703296703296704, "y1": 0.43278943278943277}, {"text": "End of paper", "x0": 0.44285714285714284, "y0": 0.7715617715617715, "x1": 0.5560439560439561, "y1": 0.7847707847707848}, {"text": "NOTES: These notes will NOT be marked.", "x0": 0.26043956043956046, "y0": 0.822066822066822, "x1": 0.6043956043956044, "y1": 0.8321678321678322}, {"text": "(\u00a9 2019 NSW Edueation Standards Authority", "x0": 0.3824175824175824, "y0": 0.9673659673659674, "x1": 0.6164835164835165, "y1": 0.9751359751359752}]]